WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,180
Cold-resistant seeds are out

2
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,620
Earlier than in the previous life

3
00:00:12,630 --> 00:00:13,790
There are eleven households in the building now

4
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:15,070
Canned meat secret door

5
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:16,350
Compressed cookie dark head

6
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:17,550
Divide planting bags together

7
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:23,580
We just moved back

8
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:24,900
I didn't get anything last time

9
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,260
The rest should be given to us

10
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,740
My mother is so sick that she can’t even eat enough.

11
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:29,900
We came back with nothing.

12
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:31,060
Of course we should be given priority

13
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:32,700
Didn't you receive supplies in the resettlement camp?

14
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:35,280
When you leave, you don’t count the people in our building.

15
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,720
Now I have to make up two copies when I get back.

16
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,840
Everyone, calm down

17
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:42,800
Stop arguing. Stop arguing. Shut up.

18
00:00:46,590 --> 00:00:47,990
You guys moved back later

19
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,990
I think it's unfair to divide them according to the current rules in the building.

20
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,790
You can go wherever you think is fair.

21
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,980
Floor Manager, keep on talking

22
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:59,660
Everyone shared the canned meat among the rest.

23
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:00,900
Take less of other things
